Error [jet.DeepCheckScopeMalformed]: `--deep-checks=tree::balance..run` isn't a deep-check scope.
 Why: A deep-check scope is a package name, alone or then `::` and module, type and function names joined by `.`; a package name is letters, digits, `_` and `-`, and every other name letters, digits and `_`.
 Fix: Write `--deep-checks` for every deep check, or name a scope, such as `--deep-checks=tree::run`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2119
